a}_{n}+\\beta {c}_{n})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(nx)+(\\alpha {b}_{n}+\\beta {d}_{n})\\operatorname{sin}⁡(nx)).\n$$\n\nUsing the linearity property of Fourier series, the corresponding Fourier coefficients of $4f(x)-g(x)$ are\n\n- $4{a}_{0}-{c}_{0}$ for the constant coefficient,\n\n- $4{a}_{n}-{c}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the cosine coefficients, and\n\n- $4{b}_{n}-{d}_{n},$ $n\\ge 1$ for the sine coefficients.\n\nTherefore, the $5$th sine coefficient of $4f(x)-g(x)$ is\n\n$$\n4{b}_{5}-{d}_{5}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186315019 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229174 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "f30ca427-3074-56c3-828a-1327d7b172b0" :knowledge-point/title "Identifying Effects of Vertical Shifting and Horizontal Reflection on Coefficients"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "360a2aae-0860-5d4c-9bf5-4484cdd5104b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{b}_{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312411} {:answer/id #uuid "6cd2c601-f75a-5664-bbef-1e5daa7b033c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{b}_{4}+1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312832} {:answer/id #uuid "76bd612d-507b-59b5-9d91-11296e214d04" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "{a}_{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186312924} {:answer/id #uuid "b666a993-d14a-58bf-bd13-496ce08cff0d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{a}_{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313390} {:answer/id #uuid "eefb1f19-ef85-5855-89a3-489eb9dc0928" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{b}_{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313882}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eefb1f19-ef85-5855-89a3-489eb9dc0928" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-{b}_{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186313882} :answer-field/id #uuid "042fd6c6-ad2